"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":7,"created_at":"2026-01-20T10:00:59Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T21:06:39Z","closed_at":"2026-01-26T21:04:57Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot 4.6 rc 1 (default physics engine is Jolt) -> affected\nGodot 4.5.1 (default physics engine is Godot physics) -> unaffected\nGodot 4.5.1, manually set the physics engine to Jolt -> affected\n\n### System information\n\nN/A\n\n### Issue description\n\nSet up a simple mechanical system and disable dissipative forces (drag). Run the simulations. Very quickly things start getting out of control: the energy flows into the system over time, making amplitudes larger.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nJust an example:\n\n* Create the ground (static body with a world boundary collision)\n* Create the ball (rigid body with a spherical collision)\n* Move the ball above the ground\n* Add a physical material to the ball, override its bounce to 1.0\n* Set the linear and angular damp modes for the ball to `Replace`\n* Set up the rest of the scene to your liking, launch and watch\n\nAlternatively, download the MRP below and just click play.\n\nWhat I would expect: energy is conserved, the ball reaches the same height with each bounce. This is exactly the behavior I see in 4.5.1 + Godot physics.\n\nThe new (Jolt) behavior: the ball jumps higher and higher every time. Energy seems to flow into the system from somewhere.\n\nI **no not** believe this can be explained by issues with the numerical precision. To my knowledge, both Jolt and Godot physics use the 0-th order integrator, which is prone to numerical precision loss, however, the Godot physics powered simulation seems to be much more stable. This effect seems to be too severe and the system too simple for precision loss to explain it.\n\nI am also not sure whether this is a problem with Jolt itself, or with the Godot-Jolt integration, though I'm leaning towards the latter.\n\nWhat I want to test next: playing with `_integrate_forces` and seeing if a 4-th order (Runge-Kutta) integrator would solve this. I have not tried this yet,  will update here if/when I do.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test_46.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24734612/test_46.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115169/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115169/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}